  "description": "Operating Area: West Mediterranean\n\nREVE2MER is an 18.20m / 60ft Catamaran Luxury Yacht built in 2016 by Lagoon with interior design by Nauta Design and later underwent a refit in 2026. Sleeping 8 guests in 4 cabins and with a crew of 4. Cruising at 12.00 kn/ph with a top speed of 15.00 kn/ph. The guest cabins comprise a primary suite with a king size bed and en-suite bathroom facilities, and 3 cabins with a king size bed and en-suite bathroom facilities.",
